The project vault sets `core.specs.site.lang: ru` and labels its tier-own `mechanic` type: the
ADR page carries `<html lang="ru">`, Russian chrome, «Решения» in the crumbs, the author «агент»,
the date with a genitive month, the badge «1 вопрос к тебе» and the value relation titled in
Cyrillic; the mechanic type page is headed «Механики» with its scenario. The review page, All
records, the tag tree from `tags.yaml` and the tag page carry only Russian labels. A second ADR
renders its Alternatives as option cards with the accepted one «выбрано» and Russian levels, its
rail «На странице», and «Ссылаются сюда» grouped by type with «через Основание» and «По разделам»
from a rule citing its `## Контекст`; every page's header holds the search box labelled «Поиск».
The core tier is pinned to a missing directory so only the project tier renders.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
latest_migration: 9999
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/config.yaml --
core:
  specs:
    tiers:
      core:
        path: no-core-specs
    site:
      lang: ru
      labels:
        ru:
          types:
            mechanic: {name: Механика, plural: Механики, scenario: "Механики — как устроен мир"}
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/_schemas/mechanic.yaml --
doc: mechanic

rules:
  - select: FRONTMATTER
    has:
      type: mechanic
      title: '^.+$'
      summary: '^.{1,200}$'
      status: { enum: [draft, accepted] }

  - select: H2
    ordered: [Loop]
    strict: true
